# Purpose
Guides users through PDF layout, content, link, data, and table checks.

# Key Sections
- When to use PDF.
- First open the PDF.
- Layout checks.
- Content checks.
- Link checks.
- Data and table checks.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- PDFs can hide copy, layout, and table extraction issues. Ask users to verify
  important final output visually.

